[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2895182634","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106641#issuecomment-2895182634","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106641","id":2895182634,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6skPsq","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-20T16:48:30Z","updated_at":"2025-05-20T16:48:30Z","body":"Happens because when creating the category tree (`Application`, `Run` TreeItems) it considers `application/run/flush_stdout_on_print.debug` property as matching the filter, specifically in this function:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/be3ecaeb3c51433058ad4e96ec892d18f4291efd/editor/editor_sectioned_inspector.cpp#L218\n\nBut later when populating the EditorInspector (the area ending empty) it filters the property based on the name without the feature tag suffix (`.debug`) and `application/run/flush_stdout_on_print` doesn't match the filter.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a12e9d5c3180a57364f419beb6a1b411bc28161d/editor/editor_inspector.cpp#L3737-L3784\n\nNot sure what's the expected behavior here, whether the filtering should ignore the feature tag part like `.debug` or not. But for sure it should be done consistently.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2895182634/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2895230619","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106641#issuecomment-2895230619","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106641","id":2895230619,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6skbab","user":{"login":"markim","id":1740400,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDA0MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1740400?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markim","html_url":"https://github.com/markim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-20T17:08:47Z","updated_at":"2025-05-20T17:08:47Z","body":"I'm not a massive C++ person, but I believe you! \n\nI can at least confirm the same issue happens when you search `.debug` as well ;)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2895230619/reactio